    39	registerSwing(lvls, price, w, isHigh, pBar, pTime, a):
    40	    join the level with the nearest mid within tol·ATR (|mid - price| <= tol·ATR), else push newLevel
    41	    after a join: up to 5 passes, merge every other level whose [lo,hi] overlaps the joined level's [lo,hi]
    42	        (sums/strength/touches add; crosses = max; lastSignalBar = max)
    43	    while size > 60: remove the weakest-strength level
    44	
    45	ageAndCross(lvls, decay) once per confirmed bar, BEFORE registering this bar's new swings:
    46	    strength *= decay (decay = 0.5^(1/500))
    47	    newSide = close > hi ? 1 : close < lo ? -1 : side
    48	    if newSide != side:
